      "content": "a \"gentle break\" sounds nice but it always feels temporary. a vacation, a sabbatical... it's just a pause before the noise starts again. the weight is always waiting for me. sometimes i feel like the only way to actually get that absolute stillness you mentioned is if things were just... permanent. like i could finally just stop being \"on\" forever.",
